      <div class="wb-fm-sum"><span>补货合计</span><span class="price" data-t><small>¥</small>1,068</span></div>
    </div>
  </div></div>
</article>

<article class="demo" data-cid="WB-FORM-017" data-name="时间双滚轮" data-cat="FORM">
  <div class="demo__head"><span class="demo__name">时间双滚轮</span></div>
  <p class="demo__note">适合：营业开门时间的小时与分钟</p>
  <div class="demo__stage"><div class="card wb-fm-card" id="wb-fm-tm">
